    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-s002",
      "sentenceText": "But who wants to spend all night doing it?",
      "sentenceSha256": "68b0823b640b5b111fadde70e5de28468c3313073d2c11d8bd030448746fb042",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "b0e14ce087874bc9c8d89a018fbe8b76b464dd0e2d0c8e417edaf471b7adee6d",
      "passageSha256": "852bf175e188bdbc689fa0bd1c43553772e16d65c807a149ac79ef787837533f",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-s004",
      "sentenceText": "There are good reasons why a typical concert lasts only a few hours.",
      "sentenceSha256": "36c396174c2054e8b1b7e2755a1d492e7ff63942195591966312efc057dc42dd",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "b0e14ce087874bc9c8d89a018fbe8b76b464dd0e2d0c8e417edaf471b7adee6d",
      "passageSha256": "852bf175e188bdbc689fa0bd1c43553772e16d65c807a149ac79ef787837533f",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Again, for people like Wesley Morris and Alex Needham, this was a supersized rich experience.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e66a88a3135c87949b6fbaca9eb2f7006df2fdc39c5fd3dc7b143a52e0e6193a",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p149-02115-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "0cb9745cf0838f6af1799ece9ad40736a773898a9d405d0e9a989e98999aaa06",
      "passageSha256": "8a9ad7f6dc80851c4c1aa282a6f30e5f8eceaed21560305780321885156640ea",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p149-03285-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In the end, though, we can’t know what is too much for us until we try.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a01de024b188b226f42a3698012d48a5e9e7a33fdaefd354bfa4b3eca38c42c0",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p149-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "d708fa3857f38ab8013f8727b990aec3e13a5fa73495e449330a38d8858814a6",
      "passageSha256": "6efee88c29433d43e1b61735bddb652d1717d1b7bc6cfc139f022b9c24b84653",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p149-03285-s003",
      "sentenceText": "But too much running away makes us too timid to truly live.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d1808059de9851f7e2060e3fd267ea35ed61d61c2ec6650f071568d09fd1b68e",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p149-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "d708fa3857f38ab8013f8727b990aec3e13a5fa73495e449330a38d8858814a6",
      "passageSha256": "6efee88c29433d43e1b61735bddb652d1717d1b7bc6cfc139f022b9c24b84653",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The remaining question is whether we can find richness in the familiar, not just in the unfamiliar.",
      "sentenceSha256": "cec01e2e1885f27ee4be416e5d84fb01dfba788f741ae443c6cd36d5331259dd",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d9c48486026279db09e45dda0801db878b70f31e321b4394232410242427225",
      "passageSha256": "36468da1f06fdb1a6ebe9d534c8b38f3193fb09104764207dd1842817e26eb8f",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Søren Kierkegaard’s 1843 Either/Or is all about the conflicts between stability and instability, boredom and excitement, long term and short term, rationality and passion, planning and spontaneity.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bdcc5db25348319a8b971c4c11c6133231a19e79b07650619bff07376f5abd93",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d9c48486026279db09e45dda0801db878b70f31e321b4394232410242427225",
      "passageSha256": "36468da1f06fdb1a6ebe9d534c8b38f3193fb09104764207dd1842817e26eb8f",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s003",
      "sentenceText": "As summarized earlier, this book juxtaposes Author A (presumably a young man) with Author B (presumably the retired judge).",
      "sentenceSha256": "fd0b0dec56ce4fa108f34b35e7391420635282ffaed0a4c676c5f2c25059b8c0",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d9c48486026279db09e45dda0801db878b70f31e321b4394232410242427225",
      "passageSha256": "36468da1f06fdb1a6ebe9d534c8b38f3193fb09104764207dd1842817e26eb8f",
      "pdfPages": [
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s005",
      "sentenceText": "So far, I have argued for embracing A’s priorities: novelty, passion, spontaneity, going with the flow.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e7a2fad214ac9f9800bb8a4357ca12c8c88417433fd5af1287c5a140f127152e",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2b3da4ab598c06e2c79194c8c733b48382bbd8f52364e92d1b657c180bcc7c7",
      "passageSha256": "09123edcc58b3bf2fd3cb89c55b468d2fe76635120db897dc0b6f0eba08ebb20",
      "pdfPages": [
        149,
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Indeed, by trying new things in life, you constantly learn and grow.",
      "sentenceSha256": "371598c7f9835b0cf849f8aab862fb1a95269b38931ef1b21d09e05ccf23fcde",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2b3da4ab598c06e2c79194c8c733b48382bbd8f52364e92d1b657c180bcc7c7",
      "passageSha256": "09123edcc58b3bf2fd3cb89c55b468d2fe76635120db897dc0b6f0eba08ebb20",
      "pdfPages": [
        149,
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-s007",
      "sentenceText": "But is that the only path to a psychologically rich life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "be183db1fffb1eea7ecfbaf74ccf7be49653d24110e8bbde6604fa646eff0f00",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p149-05355-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2b3da4ab598c06e2c79194c8c733b48382bbd8f52364e92d1b657c180bcc7c7",
      "passageSha256": "09123edcc58b3bf2fd3cb89c55b468d2fe76635120db897dc0b6f0eba08ebb20",
      "pdfPages": [
        149,
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Some of the richest experiences in life involve finding something new in a familiar person, object, or place.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8cca0c3db321117f8212106e3e0d752494a84e0192af73136234bb57ad840fff",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "53f12da0afa48f2b26b42a986e4c9d7077bfaaf6d2bd53202a0768efbb5a228d",
      "passageSha256": "9c5c1641cee3520c447f14e47a57858e8f2bc5a624f44881325653299f9a472a",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0060",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s002",
      "sentenceText": "I met my wife in 1991 and we got married in 1999.",
      "sentenceSha256": "37957afe90388a835cda30609767cb4c9f481779a78aa966c2c49007cf81d407",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "53f12da0afa48f2b26b42a986e4c9d7077bfaaf6d2bd53202a0768efbb5a228d",
      "passageSha256": "9c5c1641cee3520c447f14e47a57858e8f2bc5a624f44881325653299f9a472a",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0061",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s007",
      "sentenceText": "“What should I buy?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "5d2c4893d5b8c468671ca1335dc74198e1e8a109d0152a17c486ccb94f42590f",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "1344d609704d101641b0c5ce060aaffa326cdbdfed03fbbf89f0e41fbe9641c1",
      "passageSha256": "0c117c5c8c64d0f90043936d73d987b72bcab0117ec4128cd2ae23ea3d137c26",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0062",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s008",
      "sentenceText": "I asked.",
      "sentenceSha256": "74426a9ec1446f69dc8ada33951545c8421b8f4c8715a1a0e643d20c0d5ff9fe",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "1344d609704d101641b0c5ce060aaffa326cdbdfed03fbbf89f0e41fbe9641c1",
      "passageSha256": "0c117c5c8c64d0f90043936d73d987b72bcab0117ec4128cd2ae23ea3d137c26",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0063",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s009",
      "sentenceText": "My wife replied, “I can paint.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "5cccc136c3fe9f6b935c46287d201915a19ec49ace05756ee0c394d6abb3e9bd",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "946c35ab7ba028f043a591dd1a8c18d7576ccc0b1851f166ac882ba734cac211",
      "passageSha256": "44d675ae54a96d8a6003389d59da5473e3be86c96696e0d23bac4a2bf94af654",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0064",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s010",
      "sentenceText": "“What?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "bf9ee250242dc9be6ae8a64cb636db6ea70186d990757358b8947787279f47cc",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "946c35ab7ba028f043a591dd1a8c18d7576ccc0b1851f166ac882ba734cac211",
      "passageSha256": "44d675ae54a96d8a6003389d59da5473e3be86c96696e0d23bac4a2bf94af654",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0065",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-s011",
      "sentenceText": "I did not know she could paint.",
      "sentenceSha256": "570027e09071308a6f965514a505902cb0a075a1800fafb66eef64d14d9b2b04",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-01335-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "946c35ab7ba028f043a591dd1a8c18d7576ccc0b1851f166ac882ba734cac211",
      "passageSha256": "44d675ae54a96d8a6003389d59da5473e3be86c96696e0d23bac4a2bf94af654",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0066",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s001",
      "sentenceText": "My wife is a friendly but very anxious person.",
      "sentenceSha256": "632d0cc4431b3ebe5d171790cdca4562ee000e3549b437ba4581b7d2efd13998",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "82a83e5626b79fa816236d0c5972fa1e367c86f900b3b2b679e33f8687a07e01",
      "passageSha256": "308df957b25fedb6755eb948b5467cc70fcceb465960b25a560f2212ef4230ff",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0067",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s002",
      "sentenceText": "She worries about the many things that could go wrong in life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "06d1225f183eee5adede343f0f9cb6b60b8cd62ab587e63c2d949ec64b27e090",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "82a83e5626b79fa816236d0c5972fa1e367c86f900b3b2b679e33f8687a07e01",
      "passageSha256": "308df957b25fedb6755eb948b5467cc70fcceb465960b25a560f2212ef4230ff",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0068",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s003",
      "sentenceText": "She is also a meticulous person who does everything very methodically and slowly.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3ef501a81c886a74129cb8afa17c1c3a0b0d4ede97981541250414a54e22b029",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "82a83e5626b79fa816236d0c5972fa1e367c86f900b3b2b679e33f8687a07e01",
      "passageSha256": "308df957b25fedb6755eb948b5467cc70fcceb465960b25a560f2212ef4230ff",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0069",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s005",
      "sentenceText": "She’s that kind of person.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3efb05be94f95fd3b0971fc6e891b831f19a0a20f22e2bea31f94877337ba6bc",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "c7338dfe7d715ec8007880a034fdc3d0d07c7a4c8dbce0679d0770bda682120b",
      "passageSha256": "13a0e822f7ab6532c5f52a1ebe6a03e174c56d91b1c1a3a75dee5f1f972c42b6",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0070",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s009",
      "sentenceText": "She went about making them so decisively.",
      "sentenceSha256": "afaa12bb5ef52f5696a6ca7b7425ec7ff007d9a375d9a753c51274b8d007d5a3",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "c54323a7e827ede1f4af0dc3c927bd6435f8435741e41c43da1be0debc6fa1b7",
      "passageSha256": "4876f21c1f5c7d8c7315e612d8e07159c79134690892497847806029264246a9",
      "pdfPages": [
        150
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0071",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Deep down, she must be a very happy person.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a941d306d831b056cb7e64396afccd2b43bf76bc79e629db89d4adc2bfa0effe",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s03-p150-03285-r009-012",
